A realistic fixed-camera tabletop video in one continuous shot. During the first two seconds, three plain cardboard boxes stacked on a table remains completely still and upright. Then one small red rubber ball rolls in from the left, visibly contacts the nearest object, and only after contact the contacted objects tip over or move away in a short, clear collision chain. The ball, the contact, and the resulting movement remain visible. The camera, table, lighting, and background remain fixed throughout. | one small red rubber ball | the boxes remain upright without the ball or collision
